  "title": "System relies on Docker",
  "summary": "Our VSCode extension launches Docker in the backend for the “business logic”, but we’ve noticed that it’s a pain to setup on various systems. We’ve built it this way primarily for reproducibility. We’re building a version of the tool which doesn’t run docker on the backend, so our tool is easier to setup on people’s machines.",
